    {
      "text": "How to make pancakes by Kevin Stocker. First, mix the flour, eggs, salt, honey, milk, or water, and baking powder in a bowl. Check for lumps and squash any lumps out with a spoon. Put some oil in a pan and heat the pan until it begins getting hot. Spoon the pancakes onto the hot pan for the size of pancakes you want. Cook on one side until it see a toe bubbles on top, and then turn the pancakes over and grill until golden brown on the other side. Most importantly, enjoy some with your family or friends.",
